<title>NETHERLANDS: UNI-INVEST BUYS BUILDINGS WORTH 79.5 MLN GUILDERS.</title>
<headline>UNI-INVEST BUYS BUILDINGS WORTH 79.5 MLN GUILDERS.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Property Investment Fund Uni-Invest NV said on Tuesday it was issuing 1,165,239 new shares to pay for some of the new buildings it bought recently.</p>
<p>Uni-Invest said it bought new buildings worth 79.5 million guilders.</p>
<p>Uni-Invest said the new shares had been placed at an issue price, including the dividend rights, of 27.05 guilders, 27.20 guilders and 28 guilders per share.</p>
<p>Uni-Invest closed at 25.60 guilders per share on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
